{"abstract":[{"text":"A published property that indicates the subscription status of the user. If you’re using a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PurchaseController"},{"text":", you must set this.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwall\/subscriptionstatus"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/PublishedSubscriptionStatus","preciseIdentifier":"s:12SuperwallKit27PublishedSubscriptionStatusV","text":"PublishedSubscriptionStatus"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"subscriptionStatus"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SubscriptionStatus","preciseIdentifier":"s:12SuperwallKit18SubscriptionStatusO","text":"SubscriptionStatus"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"set"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you’re using Combine or SwiftUI, you can subscribe or bind to it to get","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"notified whenever it changes. The publisher only ever emits the merged","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"status – never a value you assigned before granted entitlements were","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"applied. Changes are delivered in the order they were made. Subscribers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are usually called on the thread that changed the status, which is often","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a background one; when several threads change it at once, one of them","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivers the others’ changes too, and a slow subscriber holds those up.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receive(on:)"},{"text":" before updating UI, and don’t block in a subscriber.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Otherwise, you can check the delegate function","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallDelegate\/subscriptionStatusDidChange(from:to:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to receive a callback whenever the logical status changes.","type":"text"}]},{"style":"warning","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you’ve set ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/Superwall\/grantedEntitlements","isActive":true},{"text":", they are merged into","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every value you assign here. Assigning ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".inactive"},{"text":" does ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"text":" remove","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them — the status stays active for as long as ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/Superwall\/grantedEntitlements","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contains an active entitlement. To revoke them, set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/Superwall\/grantedEntitlements","isActive":true},{"text":" to